    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* All characters in this game are eighteen years old or above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ Story ]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient dungeon was found. The town of comes is crowded with adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A local merchant opened a shop on the street, trying to capture the demand from the adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, he struggled to source unique items and failed to get adventurers to stop at his shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expensive wand he bought from a sketchy magician was on the shelf forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a royal magician, Elisha, visited his shop to buy a magic item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He decided to sell the wand to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But he accidentally cast a spell against Elisha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gameplay]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Elisha, go to the town and meet people,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or explore the dungeon and hunt the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The ultimate goal is to reach the last floor of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Costume and Hairstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 costumes and 2 hairstyles for Elisha can be unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elisha's look will be changed during the conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Commands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are home, you can get intimate with Elisha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish quests and progress the game to unlock more commands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are visible on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you and Elisha are knocked out, you will be sent to the town. There is no penalty or game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* All characters in this game are eighteen years old or above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ Story ]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient dungeon was found. The town of comes is crowded with adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A local merchant opened a shop on the street, trying to capture the demand from the adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, he struggled to source unique items and failed to get adventurers to stop at his shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expensive wand he bought from a sketchy magician was on the shelf forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a royal magician, Elisha, visited his shop to buy a magic item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He decided to sell the wand to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But he accidentally cast a spell against Elisha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gameplay]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Elisha, go to the town and meet people,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or explore the dungeon and hunt the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The ultimate goal is to reach the last floor of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Costume and Hairstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 costumes and 2 hairstyles for Elisha can be unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elisha's look will be changed during the conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Commands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are home, you can get intimate with Elisha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish quests and progress the game to unlock more commands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are visible on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you and Elisha are knocked out, you will be sent to the town. There is no penalty or game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
